<title>NEW ZEALAND: Bankers Trust NZ has 5 pct of Rest Brands.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust NZ has 5 pct of Rest Brands.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust New Zealand said on Thursday it became a substantial security holder in Restaurant Brands New Zealand on June 5 and had at that date a relevant interest in five percent of its voting securities.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
